   "options": "<p>Upload a <b>.zip</b> of employee photos. Each file must be named after the employee code, e.g. <code>R00496.jpg</code> &rarr; employee <b>R00496</b>. Accepted: .jpg, .jpeg, .png.</p><p>Run once with <b>Dry run</b> ticked to see what would happen, then untick it to write.</p>"
